at 87 years old.\n\nAdditional Notes:\nDuring visits, the patient's physical exams have been within normal limits. There have been no significant deviations in his neurological, cardiovascular, or respiratory exams. Minor complaints, such as occasional headaches and mild gastrointestinal discomfort, have been noted but did not require any changes in his treatment plan.\n\nOverall, Stephen Phillips is doing well with his Bipolar disorder under stable management. He continues to follow up regularly, and his treatment plan remains effective. We will continue to monitor his"
